#: .\data\talk\chara\0107_雷蛇.csv:86
msgid "“能不能再摸一下下……”"
msgstr ""

#: .\data\talk\chara\0107_雷蛇.csv:87
msgid "“不是，你以为你是谁啊？！”"
msgstr ""

#: .\data\talk\chara\0107_雷蛇.csv:88
