#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:36
msgid "{Name}为{TargetName}揉了揉手，手指在{TargetName}的掌心上细腻地揉搓。"
msgstr "{Name} rubbed {TargetName}'s hands, with their fingers rubbing on {TargetName}'s palm exquisitely."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:38
msgid "{Name}在文件架上取文件时，手指不小心碰到了{TargetName}的手，两人的手指短暂地交错在一起。"
msgstr "When {Name} was picking the files, their fingers accidentally touched {TargetName}'s hands,\\n"
"and both of their fingers crossed slightly."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:39
msgid "{Name}靠过来看着{TargetName}的屏幕时，两人的肩膀紧贴着，{Name}感觉到了{TargetName}的体温。"
msgstr "When {Name} came to look at {TargetName}'s screen, their shoulders clinged together,\\n"
"{Name} felt {TargetName}'s temperature."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:40
msgid "当{TargetName}从椅子上起身时，手不小心碰到了{Name}的肩膀，两人的眼神也瞬间交汇在一起。"
msgstr "When {TargetName} got up from the chair, their hands accidentally touched {Name}'s shoulders,\\n"
"which make their eyes crossed each other."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:41
msgid "{Name}不小心把笔掉在了地上，{TargetName}帮忙捡起来，两人的手不经意地碰了一下。"
msgstr "{Name} accidentally dropped their pen, {TargetName} helped to pick it up,\\n"
"and their hands touched unconsciously."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:42
msgid "{Name}帮{TargetName}完成了一项重要的工作，两人跳起来击了个掌来庆祝胜利。"
msgstr "{Name} helped {TargetName} to complete an important task,\\n"
"and both of them have a high five to celebrate."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:44
msgid "{TargetName}正在寻找一本书，{Name}偶然间看到了这本书并帮忙从书架里取下来，递到了{TargetName}的怀里。"
msgstr "{TargetName} was finding a book,\\n"
"{Name} saw the book coincidentally and helped to deliver it into {TargetName}'s arms."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:45
msgid "{TargetName}在看书时不小心掉了书，{Name}帮助{TargetName}把书捡起来，两个人的手叠在了一起。"
msgstr "{TargetName} accidentally dropped their book while reading,\\n"
"{Name} helped {TargetName} to pick it up, and both of their hands stacked together."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:46
msgid "{TargetName}在书架前找书，{Name}想帮忙，两人不小心撞了一下，不过都没事。"
msgstr "{TargetName} was finding a book, {Name} wanted to help,\\n"
"and both of them accidentally bumped into each other, but no injuries."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:47
msgid "{TargetName}借书时不慎把借书证掉在地上，{Name}帮忙捡了起来，还嘱咐{TargetName}要小心保管好。"
msgstr "{TargetName} accidentally dropped their library card while borrowing books,\\n"
"{Name} helped to pick it up, and reminded {TargetName} to keep it carefully."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:48
msgid "{TargetName}找不到要借的书，{Name}提供帮助并协助{TargetName}找到了需要的书籍，{TargetName}握住{Name}的手说着谢谢。"
msgstr "{TargetName} couldn't find the book they're wanting to borrow,\\n"
"and {Name} helped to assist {TargetName} on finding it,\\n"
"which {TargetName} held {Name}'s hands and thanked them."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:49
msgid "{TargetName}正沉迷于阅读中，不安分的脚不小心踢到了{Name}，{TargetName}连忙不好意思地小声道歉。"
msgstr "{TargetName} was addicted on reading at the moment, and their legs accidentally kicked {Name},\\n"
"which {TargetName} apologized softly."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:50
msgid "{TargetName}正在图书馆借书，不小心踩到地上的报纸滑倒了，{Name}赶紧过来帮忙扶起了{TargetName}。"
msgstr "{TargetName} was borrowing books in the library,\\n"
"and accidentally slipped after stepping on the newspaper on the floor,\\n"
"{Name} came over to help {TargetName} to get up."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:51
msgid "{Name}和{TargetName}一同在图书馆内找书，两人不小心撞在了一起，但{Name}眼疾手快地一把搂住了{TargetName}，两人都没有摔倒。"
msgstr "{Name} and {TargetName} were finding the book in the library,\\n"
"and both of them bumped into each other, but {Name} quickly hugged on {TargetName},\\n"
"making neither of them fell."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:52
msgid "{TargetName}想找一本书，但不知道在哪个书架上，{Name}主动帮忙，两人一起找到了需要的书籍。"
msgstr "{TargetName} wanted to find a book, but they don't know its location,\\n"
"{Name} helped and they found the book together."

#: .\data\talk\daily\stroke.csv:53
msgid "{TargetName}一边看书一边走路，不小心撞到了书架上，{Name}赶紧过来帮忙扶起来，并且关心地问{TargetName}是否摔伤了。"
msgstr "When {TargetName} was reading while walking, they bumped into the bookshelf,\\n"
"{Name} came over and helped to get them up, and asked if {TargetName} was injured."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:6
msgid "{Name}打开淋浴头，调整了水温和水流强度，快速地给自己挤好洗发水，打上肥皂，洗的干干净净"
msgstr "{Name} opened the shower head, adjusted the temperature and intensity,\\n"
"quickly applies shampoo and soup, and washed himself cleanly"

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:7
msgid "{Name}站在淋浴头下面，先是快速地冲了一遍全身，然后慢慢地涂沐浴露来洗身体，然后涂洗发水和护发素来保养头发，中间冲了好几次，最后拿起毛巾把身体擦干"
msgstr "{Name} stood under the shower head, quickly flushed once,\\n"
"then slowly washed his body with bodywash,\\n"
"then maintained his hair with shampoo and hair conditioner, flushed a few times,\\n"
"then wiped with the towel"

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:9
msgid "{Name}走进淋浴间，打开淋浴头，感受水温，调整到适合的温度，然后将整个身体都沐浴在水流下，舒展筋骨，享受水流带来的舒适感。"
msgstr "{Name} walked into the shower room, opened the shower head, felt the temperature and adjusted it,\\n"
"and then had the whole body under the water flow, feeling the comfort from it."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:10
msgid "{Name}在洗头的过程中，将洗发水倒在手心，揉搓出丰富的泡沫，然后涂抹在头发上，用指腹轻轻按摩头皮，直到头皮感觉清爽舒适。\n接着用喷头冲洗掉头发上的洗发水泡沫，同时用手指梳理头发，确保每根头发都被冲洗干净。"
msgstr "When {Name} was washing his hair, he put the shampoo on his palm, kneaded it into foam,\\n"
"then applied it on his hair,\\n"
"massaging his scalp with fingertips until it felt fresh and comfortable.\\n"
"Then he washed the foam away and had his fingers combing the hair, ensuring all of them are washed."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:11
msgid "{Name}在洗头过程中，涂抹护发素时，将其均匀地涂抹在头发上。\n然后用手指轻轻梳理头发，让护发素更好地渗透到头发里，起到护理作用。\n待护发素起效后，再用喷头冲洗干净。"
msgstr "When {Name} was washing his hair, he applied the hair conditioner averagely on his hair.\\n"
"Then he combed his hair lightly with his fingers to have the conditioner seep into the hair\\n"
"easier to ensure the caring effect.\\n"
"After it went effective, he washed them away."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:12
msgid "{Name}在洗身子的过程中，先将身体湿润后，取适量沐浴露，涂抹在身体各处，用浴球揉搓出丰富的泡沫。\n然后用力按摩身体，让泡沫深入毛孔，洗去污垢。\n接着用喷头冲洗身体，将泡沫彻底冲干净，同时用手在身体上轻轻拍打，让血液循环更加顺畅。"
msgstr "When {Name} was washing his body, he moistened his body, then wipe around with the bodywash,\\n"
"kneading foams everywhere.\\n"
"Then he massaged his body vigorously to have the foam enter the pores to clean up.\\n"
"Then he washed his body and clean off the foam,\\n"
"while plapping his body lightly to smoothen blood circulation."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:13
msgid "{Name}在洗澡前，先将浴巾挂在浴室门后，确保洗澡时不会弄湿浴巾，洗澡后方便拿取擦干身体。\n同时将浴帘拉上，确保洗澡时水不会溅出浴室，保持浴室地面干燥整洁。"
msgstr "Before {Name} went to shower, he hung the towel behind the door to ensure it doesn't get wet\\n"
"so that it'll be easier to use it.\\n"
"He also closed the curtain to ensure that water doesn't leak out to ensure the floor is dry."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:14
msgid "{Name}在洗澡过程中，先将脸部湿润后，取适量洗面奶，轻轻地在脸部打圈按摩，使洗面奶深入毛孔，洗去脸部污垢。\n然后用温水冲洗脸部，确保洗面奶完全被冲洗干净，接着用手轻轻拍打脸部，促进血液循环。"
msgstr "When {Name} was showering, he first moistened his face,\\n"
"then applied the facial cleanser on his face,\\n"
"while massaging it lightly to have the cleanser clean up the filth inside the pores.\\n"
"Then he washed his face, cleaning the cleanser away,\\n"
"while plapping his face lightly to improve blood circulation."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:15
msgid "{Name}在洗澡过程中，用指腹轻轻按摩太阳穴、颈部和肩膀，缓解一天的疲劳和紧张。\n接着，用喷头对准背部，让水流冲击背部，起到按摩背部肌肉的作用，舒缓背部疼痛。"
msgstr "When {Name} was showering, he massaged his temples, neck and shoulders with his fingertips,\\n"
"loosening the tiredness of the day.\\n"
"Then he aimed on his back with the shower head,\\n"
"and have the water pounding his back as massage to the muscles at the back, relieving the back pain."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:16
msgid "{Name}在洗脚的过程中，先用拖鞋将脚底沾湿，然后倒上磨砂膏，用力搓揉脚底，去除死皮，使脚底光滑嫩白。\n接着用喷头冲洗脚背和脚趾缝隙，确保脚部的每个部位都被清洗干净。"
msgstr "When {Name} was washing his legs, he first moistened his feet with slippers,\\n"
"then rubbed it vigorously with scrub to remove dead skin and ensure the smoothness of his feet.\\n"
"Then he washed his instep and the gaps between the toes, ensuring that all of them are cleaned."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:17
msgid "{Name}洗澡结束后，先用浴巾擦干身体，然后涂抹身体乳，将其均匀地涂抹在身体各处，让皮肤保持滋润，焕发光彩。\n最后用吹风机吹干头发，避免头发湿漉漉的感觉。\n最后用宽齿梳轻轻梳理，不用力拉扯，以免损伤头发和头皮。"
msgstr "When {Name} finished showering, he first wiped his body with the towel,\\n"
"then he applied body lotion averagely through his whole body, ensuring his body stay moisturized.\\n"
"Lastly he dried his hair with hair dryer to avoid the feeling of being wet.\\n"
"Lastly he combed his hair lightly to avoid damaging his hair and scalp."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:18
msgid "{Name}在洗澡前，先将洗发水、护发素、沐浴露和洗面奶等洗浴用品摆放在易于取用的位置，方便洗澡时能够快速找到并使用。\n用喷头冲洗身体时，顺便清洗浴室墙壁，保持浴室的清洁。\n同时，确保水温适中，以免过热或过冷影响洗澡体验。"
msgstr "Before {Name} went to shower, he first placed shampoo, conditioner, bodywash, face cream etc.\\n"
"on easy-to-reach spot so that he can find them easier.\\n"
"When washing his body, he also washed the walls to ensure it's clean.\\n"
"At the same time, he ensured the temperature was moderate\\n"
"to ensure the experience of showering not being affected."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:19
msgid "{Name}在淋浴过程中，用手轻轻按摩头发和头皮，以促进血液循环和头发生长。\n接着，用喷头对准脖子和胸部，让水流冲击这些部位，起到舒缓肌肉的作用，放松身心。\n最后，用毛巾擦干身体，避免水滴残留在皮肤上引起不适。"
msgstr "When {Name} was showering,\\n"
"he massaged his hair and scalp lightly to improve blood circulation and hair growth.\\n"
"Then, he aimed on his neck and chest with the shower head,\\n"
"letting the water pounding them to sooth muscles.\\n"
"Lastly, he wiped with his towel to avoid discomfort."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:20
msgid "{Name}在洗澡前，先将浴室内的窗户打开，保持通风良好，防止湿气积聚。\n同时，检查淋浴间的排水口是否畅通，以免洗澡时水无法顺利排出影响体验。\n最后，还会放一些芳香剂，让洗澡变得更加愉悦。"
msgstr "Before {Name} went to shower, he first opened the windows to ensure the ventilation.\\n"
"At the same time, he checked if the drain outlet was unblocked\\n"
"to ensure that the water flowed out.\\n"
"Lastly, he also put fragrances to make the showering more enjoyable."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:21
msgid "{Name}在洗身体的过程中，会使用海绵或者浴球等工具，让沐浴露更加丰富地泡沫，从而更好地清洁身体。\n同时，注意清洗腋下、肘部、膝盖等容易被忽略的部位，确保身体每个角落都被清洗干净。"
msgstr "When {Name} was washing his body,\\n"
"he would use sponge or bathball to create more foam for better body cleaning.\\n"
"At the same time, he also washed his armpits, elbows, knees, etc.\\n"
"the parts that might be missed to ensure the whole body is cleaned up."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:22
msgid "{Name}在洗头发的过程中，可以使用按摩梳，轻轻按摩头皮，促进血液循环，同时也能够帮助洗发水更好地渗透到头发里面。\n接着用喷头冲洗掉头发上的洗发水泡沫，顺便冲洗掉额头和耳朵后面的污垢，让整个头部都变得干净清爽。"
msgstr "When {Name} was washing his hair,\\n"
"he would use the massage comb to massage his scalp to improve blood circulation\\n"
"and help to have the shampoo penetrating the hair easier.\\n"
"Then he washed away the foam, together with the filth on his forehead and behind his ears\\n"
"to make the whole head clean."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:23
msgid "{Name}在淋浴前，会先进行一些简单的拉伸运动，以放松身体肌肉。\n然后会先泡个脚，让身体逐渐适应水温。\n在洗澡时，还会播放自己喜欢的音乐或者听书，让洗澡成为一种享受。"
msgstr "Before {Name} went to shower,\\n"
"he would conduct some simple stretching to make his muscles relaxed.\\n"
"Then he would soak his feet to have his body adapt to the water temperature.\\n"
"While showering, he would also play his favorite music or audiobook to make it an enjoyment."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:24
msgid "{Name}在淋浴的过程中，喜欢先将淋浴头调整成按摩模式，用水流冲击肌肉和关节，起到舒缓疲劳的作用。\n最后会将淋浴头调整成雾化模式，让水珠细致柔和，营造出更加舒适的洗澡环境。"
msgstr "When {Name} was showering, he liked to change the shower head to massage mode,\\n"
"and use the water to pound the muscles and joints to sooth the tiredness.\\n"
"Lastly, he would change the shower bead to atomization mode, making the drops soft and exquisite,\\n"
"creating a comfortable showering environment."

#: .\data\talk\daily\take_shower.csv:25
msgid "{Name}在洗澡结束后，经常使用一些保湿喷雾或者润肤霜，让皮肤更加滋润。\n同时，偶尔也会使用一些香水或者身体喷雾，让自己更加自信迷人。"
msgstr "After {Name} finished showering,\\n"
"he would use some moisturizing spray to make his skin more moisturized.\\n"
"At the same time, he would use some perfumes or body sprays to make himself more confident."

